    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Guide Naginami as they ascend the enigmatic Yora in search of their beloved, Iza. In this 2.5D adventure, utilize the Crimson Thread, to swing, grapple, and pull your way through uinque peaks and platforming challenges. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2820280/extras/b9486a2c98b4d591ce2fb1398ead9d0f.poster.avif?t=1738794791\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2820280/extras/b9486a2c98b4d591ce2fb1398ead9d0f.webm?t=1738794791\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2820280/extras/b9486a2c98b4d591ce2fb1398ead9d0f.mp4?t=1738794791\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Encounter a myriad of distinctive creatures, each offering a unique approach to the base thread mechanics providing depth in your traversal options.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cross paths with the six-eared fox, Kit, who weaves memories into the fabric of reality, revealing the bond between Naginami and Iza. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Traverse seven breathtaking peaks rich with symbolism and mystery, where every step forward brings you closer to understanding the profound connections that bind us all.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unearth tales of the lost Ambi as you encounter the seven Goddess Statures that grant additional abilities to help you in your journey.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2820280/extras/05c4b009bfa2c97f218187dddb091560.avif?t=1738794791\" width=600 height=161 /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Guide Naginami as they ascend the enigmatic Yora in search of their beloved, Iza. In this 2.5D adventure, utilize the Crimson Thread, to swing, grapple, and pull your way through uinque peaks and platforming challenges. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2820280/extras/b9486a2c98b4d591ce2fb1398ead9d0f.poster.avif?t=1738794791\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2820280/extras/b9486a2c98b4d591ce2fb1398ead9d0f.webm?t=1738794791\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2820280/extras/b9486a2c98b4d591ce2fb1398ead9d0f.mp4?t=1738794791\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Encounter a myriad of distinctive creatures, each offering a unique approach to the base thread mechanics providing depth in your traversal options.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cross paths with the six-eared fox, Kit, who weaves memories into the fabric of reality, revealing the bond between Naginami and Iza. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Traverse seven breathtaking peaks rich with symbolism and mystery, where every step forward brings you closer to understanding the profound connections that bind us all.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unearth tales of the lost Ambi as you encounter the seven Goddess Statures that grant additional abilities to help you in your journey.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2820280/extras/05c4b009bfa2c97f218187dddb091560.avif?t=1738794791\" width=600 height=161 /></span></p>",
